# Test binaries.
#
# A pattern, not a list. This was a list of names, and a new suite was
# forgotten from it three times running — test_function_table and
# test_p11_session in session 7, four more in session 9, test_cert_subject
# in session 10 — each time committing a multi-megabyte binary. The
# binaries have no extension and sit beside their sources, so the rule is
# "ignore test_*, keep the sources".
test_*
!test_*.c
!test_*.h

# gcov coverage data
*.gcda
*.gcno

# lcov reports
coverage.info
coverage_filtered.info
coverage_html/
